        " : سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنِ اَلْإِخْصَاءِ فَلَمْ يُجِبْنِي ، فَسَأَلْتُ أَبَا اَلْحَسَنِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ عَنْ ذَلِكَ فَقَالَ \"لاَ بَأْسَ بِهِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4209 - It is narrated by Al-Hasan ibn Ali ibn Fadhal, from Yunus ibn Ya'qub, who said:\nI asked Abu Abdullah (as), about castration, but Imam (as) did not answer me.\nThen I asked Abu Al-Hasan (as) about it, and Imam (as) said: \"There is no harm in it.\""
        ]
      }
